{"abstract":"In this final rule, the Bureau of Industry and Security (BIS) amends the Export Administration Regulations (EAR) by adding 37 entities under 37 entries to the Entity List. These entries are listed on the Entity List under the destinations of the People's Republic of China (China) and have been determined by the U.S. Government to be acting contrary to the national security or foreign policy interests of the United States.","action":"Final rule.","agencies":[{"raw_name":"DEPARTMENT OF COMMERCE","name":"Commerce Department","id":54,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/commerce-department","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/54","parent_id":null,"slug":"commerce-department"},{"raw_name":"Bureau of Industry and Security","name":"Industry and Security Bureau","id":241,"url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/industry-and-security-bureau","json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/241","parent_id":54,"slug":"industry-and-security-bureau"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2024/05/14/2024-10485.html","cfr_references":[{"chapter":null,"citation_url":null,"part":"744","title":15}],"citation":"89 FR 41886","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":null,"correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"This rule is effective May 9, 2024.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":["Docket No. 240507-0130"],"dockets":[{"supporting_documents":[],"agency_name":"BIS","documents":[{"comment_count":0,"comment_start_date":"2024-05-14","updated_at":"2024-09-03T17:21:55.837-04:00","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/BIS-2024-0034-0001","allow_late_comments":false,"id":"BIS-2024-0034-0001","comment_end_date":null,"regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false}],"supporting_documents_count":0,"id":"BIS-2024-0034","title":"Additions to the Entity List"}],"document_number":"2024-10485","effective_on":"2024-05-09","end_page":41895,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_orde